equate 81@AltJunctTinyBit 30@JuncAlterRoute2
equate 54@BoulderChamber 3.2@Water
equate 61@BoulderChamber 70@BoulderChamberRoute2
equate 20@BoulderChamberRoute2 9@OffShoot
